&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building Nebius Token Factory — an AI inference platform that powers high-performance, cost-efficient workloads at scale. As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Technical Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll own one of our core product streams and drive it end to end: from roadmap and design to launch and adoption of features our customers rely on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are welcome to work remote from the &lt;strong&gt;UK&lt;/strong&gt;, or hybrid from our &lt;strong&gt;Amsterdam &lt;/strong&gt;location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product roadmap, delivery and developer experience for one of our flagship product direction - Dedicated Endpoints for AI Models Inference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering and research to design tools that let customers run large-scale, high-load inference workloads efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support sales &amp;amp; customers by preparing materials, leading PoCs/betas, and ensuring smooth onboarding of complex workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive product–market fit through continuous user research, customer interviews, and market &amp;amp; competitive analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage technical partnerships and ensure integrations deliver measurable value despite limited resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3–5 years &lt;/strong&gt;of product management experience, shipping technical products with 10–15+ cross-functional stakeholders(engineering, research, design, support, marketing, legal, leadership).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on mindset &lt;/strong&gt;— a power user of your own product, comfortable diving into:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;AIOps lifecycle: inference, experimentation, evaluation, fine-tuning, deployment&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Cloud-native and DevOps tooling&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Distributed systems and production infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent execution and project management skills&lt;/strong&gt; — roadmaps, milestones, ownership, Agile processes, sprints, and change management (without creating chaos).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outstanding communication &lt;/strong&gt;— able to write crisp PRDs, RFCs, runbooks, and release notes; articulate constraints and trade-offs clearly to technical and non-technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical fluency &lt;/strong&gt;— able to speak the same language as engineering, define precise requirements, understand constraints, and make sensible trade-offs grounded in reality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;B2B SaaS experience&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally working with enterprise customers and technical buyer personas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-obsessed &lt;/strong&gt;— proactive in uncovering needs, understanding customer AI strategy, and ensuring our product becomes essential in their stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias toward action &lt;/strong&gt;— runs problems end-to-end without waiting for instruction, even with incomplete data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;What Cognite is:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Relentless&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;to achieve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cognite operates at the forefront of &lt;strong&gt;industrial digitalization, building AI&lt;/strong&gt;, and data solutions that solve the world’s hardest, highest-impact problems. With unmatched industrial heritage and a comprehensive suite of AI capabilities, including low-code AI agents, Cognite accelerates the digital transformation to drive operational improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We thrive in challenges. We challenge assumptions. We execute with speed and ownership. If you view obstacles as signals to step forward - not backwards - you’ll feel right at home here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference&quot;&gt;Moonshot&lt;/a&gt; is bold: Unlock $100B in customer value by 2035, and redefine how global industry works. Join us in this venture where AI and data meet ingenuity, and together, we will forge the path to a smarter, more connected industrial future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; width=&quot;708&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;How you’ll demonstrate&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Cognite, we&#39;re transforming the world&#39;s most asset-intensive industries through Industrial AI. Our customers rely on us to turn complex industrial data into meaningful business outcomes—and this is where you come in.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Project Manager who enjoys solving complex challenges, takes ownership of outcomes, and is motivated by delivering measurable value. This role goes beyond managing timelines; you&#39;ll lead transformational AI implementation projects that help some of the world&#39;s largest industrial organisations modernise the way they operate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;From contract signing through deployment and value realisation, you&#39;ll partner with customers and cross-functional teams to deliver successful projects that create lasting business impact.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Impact&lt;/span&gt; you bring to Cognite&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As the Project Manager, you&#39;ll be accountable for the successful delivery of complex Industrial AI implementation projects by:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading end-to-end project delivery from kickoff through deployment, adoption, and value realisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning project scope, schedule, budget, quality, customer outcomes, and commercial performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with Solution Architects, Software Engineers, Data Scientists, Product teams, and Customer Success to deliver high-quality solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translating customer objectives into measurable success metrics and facilitating Value Realisation Workshops to demonstrate business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing project financials, including forecasting, revenue recognition, profitability, cost management, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building trusted relationships with customer stakeholders, leading steering committees, and providing clear communication throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying and managing risks, dependencies, and scope changes while ensuring appropriate governance and transparency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting customer adoption through change management, enablement, and training while recognising opportunities to expand customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to the continuous improvement of delivery practices by applying Cognite&#39;s PMO methodologies, playbooks, and lessons learned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Computer Science, or a related technical discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience delivering complex software, SaaS, cloud, or enterprise technology implementation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing enterprise or industrial digital transformation programmes involving multiple stakeholders and technical workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency with APIs, integrations, cloud platforms, data architecture, and enterprise systems, enabling effective collaboration with technical teams and informed decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and financial acumen, including forecasting, revenue recognition, margin management, and project profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within one or more industrial sectors, including Energy, Manufacturing, Oil &amp;amp; Gas, Chemicals, Utilities, Power &amp;amp; Renewables, or Life Sciences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Agile delivery methodologies and project governance frameworks such as Scrum, PMP, or PRINCE2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to engage confidently across technical teams, customers, and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using project management tools such as Jira, Confluence, Microsoft Project, or Smartsheet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 25% as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Preferred skills:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We&#39;re particularly interested if you also bring experience in:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP, PRINCE2, Agile, or Scrum certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud platforms such as Azure or AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industrial IoT, SCADA, MES, or Operational Technology (OT) environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI, Machine Learning, Data Engineering, or Analytics implementation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Cognite?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cognite, you&#39;ll have the opportunity to work at the forefront of Industrial AI, partnering with some of the world&#39;s leading industrial organisations to solve complex, real-world challenges.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll join a collaborative, inclusive, and fast-moving environment where innovation, curiosity, and continuous learning are encouraged. We value diverse perspectives and believe great ideas come from people with different experiences and backgrounds.&lt;br&gt;If you&#39;re excited by technology, enjoy working with customers to solve meaningful problems, and want to help shape the future of industry, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn more about us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/resources/blog/key-highlights-from-impact-2025&quot;&gt;Impact 2025&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference&quot;&gt;Cognite&#39;s Industrial AI: Moonshot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re globally recognized domain experts with an international presence that spans Phoenix, Houston, Oslo Tokyo, Bengaluru, and Abu Dhabi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cognite is committed to creating a diverse and inclusive environment at work and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive the same level of consideration for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead complex digital transformations for some of the world&#39;s most recognized brands.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have you ever wondered what it takes to deliver highly technical software implementations at enterprise scale? Join our Professional Services team and help customers unlock the full potential of Coveo&#39;s AI-powered platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 1,000 implementations delivered over the years for global organizations such as Dell, Rolex, and Salesforce, our team tackles complex technical challenges every day. You&#39;ll play a key role in aligning business objectives, technical requirements, and project execution to ensure successful customer outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As one of our Technical Project Managers, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the implementation of Coveo&#39;s platform by defining project scope, objectives, milestones, and success criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary delivery lead and trusted advisor for customer stakeholders, driving alignment, decision-making, and accountability throughout the implementation lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate customer stakeholders, internal experts, and project resources while managing expectations throughout the engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain detailed project plans, proactively tracking budgets, timelines, dependencies, and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project changes, assess impacts, and implement mitigation strategies to minimize delays and risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate project progress regularly to customers and internal stakeholders through status reports, governance meetings, and executive updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, assess, document, mitigate, and escalate risks when required to ensure successful project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with architects, developers, and technical customer stakeholders to translate business requirements into user stories and implementation decisions that maximize customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here is what will qualify you for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 7 years of experience gathering requirements, producing technical documentation, and coordinating quality assurance activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3 years of experience managing large-scale information technology implementation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the technical challenges associated with implementing cloud-based software solutions and web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management, leadership, organizational, and communication skills in complex customer-facing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence and collaborate effectively with developers, architects, business stakeholders, and executive sponsors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will make you stand out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Agile delivery methodologies and tools such as Jira and Azure DevOps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management certifications such as Project Management Professional (PMP), Scrum Master, or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with web development or software engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of enterprise search, indexing technologies, Salesforce ecosystems, or professional services automation tools such as Certinia (formerly FinancialForce) or Mavenlink.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a consulting, professional services, or customer implementation environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires strong English communication skills, as you will work primarily with English-speaking customers and stakeholders across North America and global markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you think you can bring this role to life? Send us your application, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Coveolife!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage all qualified candidates to apply regardless of, for example, age, gender, disability, gaps in CV, national or ethnic background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description was written by humans, assisted by AI. We may leverage technology in our hiring process to help us see the person behind the resume.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coveo is committed to providing accessible employment practices. If you require accommodation due to a disability at any point during the recruitment process, please contact ----- to discuss your needs.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

