&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Payments Architect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: London (Hybrid) | Practice Area: Technology &amp;amp; Engineering | Type: Permanent&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lead innovative payments transformation across financial services.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is a global leader in technology and business consulting, dedicated to driving digital innovation and transformation in financial services. We’ve partnered with over 100 clients worldwide - from pioneering FinTech&#39;s to established global institutions - helping them adapt, compete, and scale in a rapidly evolving industry. With more than 30 offices globally, we combine deep expertise in banking, payments, capital markets, insurance, wealth and asset management, and energy with an agile, inclusive, and entrepreneurial culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;1547&quot; data-end=&quot;2101&quot;&gt;You will play a central role in shaping and delivering some of our clients&#39; most critical payments transformation programmes, applying your expertise in enterprise and solution architecture alongside your deep knowledge of payments. You will help modernise core payment platforms and enable new digital payment capabilities while guiding clients through complex regulatory, operational, and technology change. Your work will influence how banks and financial institutions build, operate, and innovate across domestic and international payment ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2103&quot; data-end=&quot;2806&quot;&gt;Working closely with engineers, you will design scalable and resilient payment solutions while helping senior stakeholders shape long-term payments strategies and investment decisions. You will also lead high-performing teams, mentor junior technologists, and contribute to the growth of our Technology &amp;amp; Engineering Practice through thought leadership, community engagement, and supporting new client opportunities. You&#39;ll be encouraged to adopt approved AI-enabled tools and automation to enhance architecture design, accelerate analysis, improve documentation quality and support more informed decision-making, while applying appropriate human judgement, governance and responsible AI principles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tzcido&quot; data-start=&quot;2831&quot; data-end=&quot;3032&quot;&gt;Lead the architecture and modernisation of complex payment platforms across domestic, international, real-time, on-us and card payment ecosystems, delivering scalable, resilient and secure solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;184q86g&quot; data-start=&quot;3033&quot; data-end=&quot;3240&quot;&gt;Define payments technology strategies, target architectures and transformation roadmaps while working closely with business, engineering and delivery teams to guide implementation and investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6tzybc&quot; data-start=&quot;3241&quot; data-end=&quot;3522&quot;&gt;Apply modern architecture practices including microservices, event-driven design, cloud-native technologies and DevOps, leveraging approved AI-enabled workflows where appropriate to improve productivity, design quality and delivery outcomes while maintaining human oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sw18si&quot; data-start=&quot;3523&quot; data-end=&quot;3722&quot;&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior client stakeholders, mentor technical teams and contribute to Capco&#39;s Technology &amp;amp; Engineering community through thought leadership and business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wy2twa&quot; data-start=&quot;3723&quot; data-end=&quot;3925&quot;&gt;Ensure architectural decisions align with regulatory requirements, security, resilience, governance and responsible AI principles where AI-enabled capabilities form part of the solution landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kueo3&quot; data-start=&quot;3958&quot; data-end=&quot;4126&quot;&gt;Proven experience designing or modernising payment platforms across Faster Payments, Bacs, CHAPS, SWIFT, SEPA, Open Banking, ISO 20022 and related payment ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;un8nb3&quot; data-start=&quot;4127&quot; data-end=&quot;4320&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in enterprise and solution architecture, distributed systems, cloud technologies, modern engineering practices and recognised frameworks such as TOGAF and Domain-Driven Design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ta949w&quot; data-start=&quot;4321&quot; data-end=&quot;4468&quot;&gt;Strong consulting, stakeholder management and leadership experience with the ability to influence senior technology and business decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1j6p7jk&quot; data-start=&quot;4469&quot; data-end=&quot;4608&quot;&gt;Experience delivering large-scale payments transformation programmes using agile delivery methodologies and modern engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uf15dy&quot; data-start=&quot;4609&quot; data-end=&quot;4852&quot;&gt;A curiosity for AI-enabled ways of working and an understanding of how approved AI tools, automation and responsible AI governance can improve architectural delivery while maintaining appropriate review, auditability and human judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9fmxsi&quot; data-start=&quot;4879&quot; data-end=&quot;4968&quot;&gt;Senior consulting experience delivering large-scale payments transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;u6q66x&quot; data-start=&quot;4969&quot; data-end=&quot;5048&quot;&gt;Experience leading pre-sales engagements, proposals and commercial estimates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lorjzp&quot; data-start=&quot;5049&quot; data-end=&quot;5276&quot;&gt;Awareness of emerging technologies including digital wallets, tokenisation, embedded finance and AI (including Generative AI and Agentic AI), AI-driven fraud detection and intelligent automation within payment ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1o55480&quot; data-start=&quot;5277&quot; data-end=&quot;5374&quot;&gt;Knowledge of financial crime, AML controls, payment fraud prevention and security architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1j6y0qv&quot; data-start=&quot;5375&quot; data-end=&quot;5493&quot;&gt;Exposure to international payment ecosystems and relevant architecture or cloud certifications such as TOGAF or AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Capco?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Capco, you’ll be part of a collaborative, entrepreneurial, and inclusive culture working with Tier 1 financial services enterprises on impactful and enriching projects. We offer a competitive, people-first benefits package to support your growth as both a technologist and a consultant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health and dental insurance, life insurance, and critical illness cover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental health: &lt;/strong&gt;access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations, and in-house first aiders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family-friendly: &lt;/strong&gt;maternity, adoption, shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause, and bereavement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family care: &lt;/strong&gt;8 complimentary backup care sessions for emergency childcare or elder care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holiday flexibility: &lt;/strong&gt;5 weeks of annual leave with the option to buy or sell days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous learning: &lt;/strong&gt;minimum 40 hours of annual training, including workshops, certifications, e-learning, and ongoing business coaching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extra perks: &lt;/strong&gt;Gympass (Wellhub), travel insurance, Tastecard, season ticket loans, and Cycle to Work scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at Capco&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re committed to making our recruitment process accessible and straightforward. If you need adjustments at any stage, please let us know. We value each person’s unique perspective and contribution. At Capco, we believe that being yourself is your greatest strength. Our #BeYourselfAtWork culture encourages individuality and collaboration—a mindset that shapes how we work with clients and each other every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have been informed of recruitment scams targeting the public.&amp;nbsp;Always verify identities before engaging in recruitment communication. All&amp;nbsp;official Capco&amp;nbsp;communication will be conducted via a Capco recruiter.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be the founding analytics engineer in Finance, shaping our data infrastructure and analytical capabilities during a critical transformation. Your expertise in Python, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;DBT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, SQL, and Databricks will drive operational efficiency, accelerate our month-end close, and deliver strategic insights that inform capital allocation and IPO readiness. This is a greenfield opportunity to own the analytics roadmap, work directly with Finance leadership, and build infrastructure that powers both scaling and compliance, all at a pivotal moment for Mews&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you would do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop analytical features that surface actionable insights for Finance leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, optimise and maintain production-ready ETL/ELT pipelines using DBT, Databricks and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create scalable data models and analytical solutions using modern data modelling techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and champion data quality and testing practices; catch errors before they reach stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across Finance to translate business requirements into technical implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for modern data practices and continuous improvement of the stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you would bring&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on production experience building and optimising ETL/ELT pipelines (minimum 3 years)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL and Python; strong experience with DBT or equivalent modern data transformation tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Databricks or similar cloud data platforms, or willingness to ramp quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data modelling and analytics architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working autonomously and managing priorities with ambiguity; ability to break down complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated commitment to data quality, testing and accuracy; take pride in work that&#39;s been thoroughly validated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency Level 3:&lt;/strong&gt; In this role, you&#39;ll redesign how Finance approaches data discovery and analysis using AI—not just automating your own work, but building patterns and tools that shape how the whole team questions data and validates insights. You&#39;ll use AI to accelerate model development and testing, but critically, you&#39;ll actively question what it produces and know when to push back. You&#39;ve built processes others follow; here, you&#39;ll do that with AI as a core enabler.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current&quot; href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/x/XQOskg&quot;&gt;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&lt;/a&gt; on Confluence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data visualisation tools like Power BI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background working with regulated or governed data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling analytics in fast-growing startups or scale-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€46.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€65.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Czechia&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;867 000 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 598 000 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£49,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£55,500 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$54,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$65,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Telnyx&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Telnyx is an industry leader that&#39;s not just imagining the future of global connectivity—we&#39;re building it. From architecting and amplifying the reach of a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/our-network&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;private, global, multi-cloud IP network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, to bringing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/resources/about-edge-connectivity&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;hyperlocal edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; technology right to your fingertips through intuitive APIs, we&#39;re shaping a new era of seamless interconnection between people, devices, and applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re driven by a desire to transform and modernize what&#39;s antiquated, automate the manual, and solve real-world problems through innovative connectivity solutions. As a testament to our success, we&#39;re proud to stand as a financially stable and profitable company. Our robust profitability allows us not only to invest in pioneering technologies but also to foster an environment of continuous learning and growth for our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our collective vision is a world where borderless connectivity fuels limitless innovation. By joining us, you can be part of laying the foundations for this interconnected future. We&#39;re currently seeking passionate individuals who are excited about the opportunity to contribute to an industry-shaping company while growing their own skills and careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
