&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re building local Enterprise Sales Pods across global markets — one AE and one Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE), working together to build a Telnyx enterprise business in France and the Nordics. This is not a remote overlay on an existing territory. You will own a named-account list of 30–40 enterprise accounts across France, Sweden, Denmark, Norway, and Finland, and your job is to turn those accounts into production Telnyx customers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll work side-by-side with a dedicated FDE — not a demo resource, but a technical partner who designs architectures, builds POCs, and gets the first workload live. You win together. No throw-over-the-wall.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a founding role. You&#39;ll help define how Telnyx sells into enterprise accounts in France and the Nordics, set the playbook, and build the references that the next wave of hires will follow.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;The Pod Model&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Enterprise AE&lt;/em&gt; — owns the named-account list, builds executive relationships, gets in the room, owns commercial qualification and close, expands the account.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Forward Deployed Engineer&lt;/em&gt; — owns technical discovery, designs the architecture, builds the POC when gated, gets the first workload live, removes blockers and finds the next workload.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We sell the &lt;em&gt;workload&lt;/em&gt;, not the SKU. Customers buy a production outcome — an AI contact center, a SOC/NOC agent, global communications, connected mobility, or enterprise inference — that runs on Telnyx primitives (voice, messaging, numbers, wireless, Voice AI, inference, agents, connectivity). You lead with the outcome conversation, not a product menu.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Own a territory of 30–40 named enterprise accounts across France and the Nordics (Sweden, Denmark, Norway, Finland), narrowing to ~10 Tier 1 accounts worth $1M+ in annual potential&lt;br&gt;• Build executive relationships — get in the room with CIOs, CTOs, VP Engineering, and line-of-business owners&lt;br&gt;• Run the full sales cycle: prospect, qualify, design the commercial architecture with your FDE, negotiate, and close&lt;br&gt;• Sell production outcomes, not individual products — lead with &quot;let&#39;s deploy an AI agent that operates your SOC or NOC workflow,&quot; not &quot;which Telnyx products do you want?&quot;&lt;br&gt;• Agree the commercial destination before any custom work begins — no free discovery or free development&lt;br&gt;• Maintain disciplined POC management: every POC has a named executive sponsor, written success criteria, production pricing discussed, a decision date, and a signed commercial document. POCs end in production or they end&lt;br&gt;• Expand the account — one workload becomes three, one $500K customer becomes a $2M customer&lt;br&gt;• Build local references and case studies across Paris, Stockholm, Copenhagen, Oslo, and Helsinki&lt;br&gt;• Provide accurate pipeline reporting and forecasting — no surprises&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 5+ years of enterprise sales experience selling into French and/or Nordic markets — CPaaS, UCaaS, CCaaS, telecom, AI/ML, or similarly technical infrastructure&lt;br&gt;• Proven track record of consistently exceeding quota ($1M+ deals)&lt;br&gt;• Experience selling to both executive and technical buyers — you can hold your own in the boardroom and in the architecture review&lt;br&gt;• Hunter mentality — you build your own pipeline and thrive on outbound, in-person selling&lt;br&gt;• Strong consultative selling skills: can build a clear, compelling ROI story for both technical and business buyers&lt;br&gt;• Familiarity with sales methodologies (MEDDPICC, Challenger, SPIN, etc.)&lt;br&gt;• Comfortable with modern sales tools (Salesforce, Outreach, Gong, etc.)&lt;br&gt;• Excellent written and verbal communication in French and English. You listen before you pitch.&lt;br&gt;• Willingness to be in the field — visiting customers in person is a core part of this role&lt;br&gt;• Based in Paris, or willing to relocate — this is a hybrid role with travel across France and the Nordics&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
